.TH "PERCH-OUTBOUND-LIST" "1" "" "perch" "perch manual"
.SH NAME
perch\-outbound\-list \- list submitted messages
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B perch outbound list [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Print recent outbound submissions, optionally filtered by account. \-\-limit defaults to 100.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-config <value>
configuration file (default: ~/.config/perch/perch.yaml)
.TP
.B \-\-account <value>
filter by account email
.TP
.B \-\-limit <value>
maximum rows (default: 100)
.TP
.B \-\-help, \-h
show help
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
perch outbound list \-\-limit 20
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBperch\fR(1), \fBperch\-outbound\fR(1)
